  "solution": "**Logic: Second no. = [(First no. × 3) + 11]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**9 ∶ 38 →**\n\n​⇒ [(9 × 3) + 11]\n\n​⇒ (27 + 11) = 38\n\n**24 ∶ 83 →**\n\n​⇒ [(24 × 3) + 11]\n\n​⇒ (72 + 11) = 83\n\nSimilarly, for '13 : ?' →\n\n​⇒ [(13 × 3) + 11]\n\n​⇒ (39 + 11) = **50**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".\n\n80:T671,\n<p",
